ath-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Combinator}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Combinator}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8d1b6ff7d633b15e\" href=\"?note=8d1b6ff7d633b15e\" title=\"56-df-combinatory-logic\">56-df-combinatory-logic</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FPC}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(Y)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Combinator}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(Y)\\land\\forall x\\in V\\;(Yx\\leftrightarrow_{\\mathrm{CL}}^*x(Yx)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FPC}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(Y)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Combinator}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(Y)\\land\\forall x\\in V\\;(Yx\\leftrightarrow_{\\mathrm{CL}}^*x(Yx)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 3.3.17（印刷 p70，OCR 页块91）。定义只要求可转换，而不无依据地强化为指定方向的一步归约。闭性使选择变量名字无关紧要。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-combinatory-logic","status":"resolved","id":"8d1b6ff7d633b15e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-combinatory-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-relation-closure","status":"resolved","id":"9ddd157960e9574a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-relation-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-combinatory-logic","status":"resolved","id":"8d1b6ff7d633b15e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $Y\\in T_{\\mathrm{CL}}$，$x\\in V$。$\\leftrightarrow_{\\mathrm{CL}}^*$ 是 CL 归约的转换闭包；$\\mathrm{Combinator}_{\\mathrm{CL}}$ 见 [[56-df-combinatory-logic]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"Y\\in T_{\\mathrm{CL}}","display":false},{"tex":"